    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the ultimate drift racing sensation in Drift Legends 2, the second installment of the incredibly realistic 3D drifting game. Take control of highly-detailed legendary drift cars and conquer various tracks as you strive to break records. Test your skills in a multiplayer game mode, if you think you are tough enough. Challenge other drivers and ascend to the pinnacle of the online leaderboard. Progress from a novice to a professional drift driver. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FEATURES:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Realistic physics, simulating every aspect of car behavior;<br>- Drive more than 50 powerful and exciting, highly detailed drifting cars;<br>- Drift on detailed tracks with different layouts;<br>- Career mode allows you to get more experience, complete achievements and unlock powerful secret cars;<br>- Every car behaves differently. Feel the power and weight, find your balance;<br>- Customize your cars with exclusive paintjobs, rims, tires and plates;<br>- Real engine sounds for every car;<br>- Turbocharger, gearbox and tires sounds;<br>- Realistic 3D graphics;<br>- Online drift multiplayer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're a car enthusiast, this game is definitely for you!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the ultimate drift racing sensation in Drift Legends 2, the second installment of the incredibly realistic 3D drifting game. Take control of highly-detailed legendary drift cars and conquer various tracks as you strive to break records. Test your skills in a multiplayer game mode, if you think you are tough enough. Challenge other drivers and ascend to the pinnacle of the online leaderboard. Progress from a novice to a professional drift driver. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FEATURES:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Realistic physics, simulating every aspect of car behavior;<br>- Drive more than 50 powerful and exciting, highly detailed drifting cars;<br>- Drift on detailed tracks with different layouts;<br>- Career mode allows you to get more experience, complete achievements and unlock powerful secret cars;<br>- Every car behaves differently. Feel the power and weight, find your balance;<br>- Customize your cars with exclusive paintjobs, rims, tires and plates;<br>- Real engine sounds for every car;<br>- Turbocharger, gearbox and tires sounds;<br>- Realistic 3D graphics;<br>- Online drift multiplayer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're a car enthusiast, this game is definitely for you!</p>",
